      "Language": "spa",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Chronic pain is a persistent pain which continues to afflict a patient despite treatment of the causes which originated that pain and which interferes in the normal everyday family and working life of that patient, developing at times into his/her only problem and conditioning his/her life and that of his/her family and acquaintances. Chronic pain is a worldwide disorder and it affects 23.4% of the population in Spain."},
